WEBVTT

00:01:56.946 --> 00:02:00.199
when you get pregnant
and not living with a partner.

00:02:01.159 --> 00:02:03.286
So because of that,

00:02:03.327 --> 00:02:06.914
my mother tried to abort me
multiple times.

00:02:07.540 --> 00:02:11.085
All, which as you can see,
didn’t succeed.

00:02:11.127 --> 00:02:12.295
(Laughter)

00:02:12.336 --> 00:02:14.922
It did leave me with some health problems,

00:02:14.964 --> 00:02:16.132
but I survived.

00:02:18.134 --> 00:02:21.929
I was called, for a very
long time “anolїtpё”,

00:02:21.929 --> 00:02:24.724
which literally means trash.

00:02:25.391 --> 00:02:30.813
My father denied that he was my father
because of pressure from his family.